WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:14.080
Ommaviy yuklash zarurati va sekinlik sababi

00:14.080 --> 00:27.457
Kichik amallarni bitta amalga birlashtirish

00:27.457 --> 00:40.245
PostgreSQL COPY buyrug‘i

00:40.245 --> 00:53.926
Server fayli va psql ning \copy buyrug‘i

00:53.926 --> 01:07.418
Indekslar, cheklovlar va xotira sozlamalari

01:07.418 --> 01:20.580
Xatolarni boshqarish: ON_ERROR ignore va REJECT_LIMIT
